  "method": "Three fresh Chromium pages per version, 1440 x 900. Wait for the real Monet events then leave the painting visible for exactly 1000 ms. Click via the DOM; use performance.now for handler and two requestAnimationFrame callbacks for a paint opportunity. MutationObserver records code DOM changes, a Worker wrapper records round trips, PerformanceObserver records tasks >= 50 ms and a port-handler wrapper records each preparation batch. No waiting for formatter readiness before clicking. Paint opportunity timings include browser scheduling jitter.",
